| 5 | 2025-09 | 6 | 0.900 | 0.961 | 0.362 | 0.935 |

**Key finding:** No-change wins in every fold. U-Net improves significantly with more
training data (0.392 → 0.900) but never beats the no-change baseline on aggregate
metrics because territorial control is too persistent.

